---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import portrait from "@/assets/launch/portrait.png";
---

<div class="grid h-dvh w-full place-items-center overflow-hidden bg-[#0f0f0d] [container-type:size]">
  <section
    class="relative aspect-[900/507] w-[min(100cqw,calc(100cqh*1.775148))] overflow-hidden bg-[#0f0f0d] font-inter text-[#ffffff] antialiased [container-type:size]"
    aria-label="An intimate launch, fully produced"
  >
    <p
      class="eyebrow absolute right-[1.975%] top-[4.931%] m-0 whitespace-nowrap text-[#fff]"
    >
      CASE STUDY • NRD55 × LAILA HASANOVIC
    </p>

    <h2 class="m-0">
      <span class="headline absolute left-[4.02%] top-[26.81%] m-0 whitespace-nowrap">
        An intimate launch,
      </span>
      <span class="headline-italic absolute left-[4.02%] top-[37.67%] m-0 whitespace-nowrap">
        fully produced.
      </span>
    </h2>

    <p
      class="body absolute left-[4.02%] top-[54.89%] m-0 whitespace-nowrap text-[#fff]"
    >
      FORMA curated and executed the NRD55 launch in collaboration with Laila
      <br />
      Hasanovic - an intimate dinner at Bar Moro followed by an afterparty at Sopavillon.
    </p>

    <p
      class="body-muted absolute left-[4%] top-[64.24%] m-0 whitespace-nowrap"
    >
      Concept, production, transportation, execution, and guest list - all managed end-to-end.
    </p>

    <Image
      src={portrait}
      alt="Close portrait of Laila Hasanovic with a bronze product swatch on her cheek"
      class="pointer-events-none absolute left-[53.3%] top-[16.73%] h-[44.47%] w-[42.94%] max-w-none object-cover"
    />

    <p
      class="quote absolute left-[53.249%] top-[64.574%] m-0 whitespace-nowrap"
    >
      “Working with FORMA felt easy and natural from start to finish. They
      <br />
      truly understood the vision and created a setting that felt personal,
      <br />
      thoughtful, and aligned with everything we wanted to achieve.”
    </p>

    <p
      class="attribution absolute left-[53.249%] top-[76.644%] m-0 whitespace-nowrap opacity-65"
    >
      — LAILA HASANOVIC • FOUNDER, NRD55
    </p>
  </section>
</div>
